{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/share()"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"share"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncBroadcastSequence"},{"type":"text","text":" that multicasts elements to multiple consumers concurrently."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This operator is an alias for "},{"code":"broadcast()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", providing identical behavior."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It enables multicasting of values from the upstream sequence to multiple"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"concurrent consumers without duplicating upstream work. A consumer receives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the elements the shared sequence reads from the upstream after the consumer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creates its iterator; elements already read and handed out are not replayed."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Create an AsyncStream that emits 3 random values between 1 and 5","let upstream = AsyncStream<Int> { continuation in","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.yield(Int.random(in: 1...5))","    continuation.finish()","}","","let sharedSequence = upstream.share()","","async let firstConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"First consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","async let secondConsumer = Task {","    for await value in sharedSequence {","        print(\"Second consumer received \\(value)\")","    }","    \/\/ prints the values the shared sequence reads after this consumer subscribed","}","","\/\/ A consumer that subscribes after the shared sequence has handed out values misses them.","await firstConsumer.value","await secondConsumer.value"],"syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"ShareSequence.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/SequenceOperators\/ShareSequence.swift#L113"},"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","title":"share()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"relatedModules":["_Concurrency"],"name":"Afluent"}],"externalID":"s:Sci7Afluents8SendableRzsAB7ElementRpzrlE5shareAA22AsyncBroadcastSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:7Afluent18PassthroughSubjectC","conformance":{"constraints":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Self"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Element"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}],"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}]},"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject\/share()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/AsyncBroadcastSequence":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/asyncbroadcastsequence","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncBroadcastSequence","title":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An async sequence that multicasts elements from an upstream sequence to multiple concurrent consumers."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent":{"title":"Afluent","url":"\/documentation\/afluent","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","type":"topic"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject/share()":{"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject\/share()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject\/share()","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence that multicasts elements to multiple concurrent consumers.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","conformance":{"conformancePrefix":[{"text":"Conforms when","type":"text"}],"constraints":[{"code":"Self","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"Element","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conforms to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sendable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"availabilityPrefix":[{"text":"Available when","type":"text"}]},"title":"share()","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"share","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent22AsyncBroadcastSequenceV","text":"AsyncBroadcastSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://Afluent/documentation/Afluent/PassthroughSubject":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/PassthroughSubject","kind":"symbol","title":"PassthroughSubject","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"url":"\/documentation\/afluent\/passthroughsubject","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PassthroughSubject"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A subject that broadcasts values to multiple consumers without storing a current value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unlike ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"CurrentValueSubject"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PassthroughSubject"},{"text":" does not retain the most recent value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AsyncSequence"},{"text":" that allows multiple tasks to asynchronously consume values and mimics Combine’s PassthroughSubject.","type":"text"}]}}}